SUMMARY: Improv and Acting in the Pub!
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nHello everyone\,\n\nPlease join us
  for a great afternoon of **Improv and Acting in the Pub!**\nThis is a wel
 l-organized event filled with improv games\, skits and lots of hilarious s
 cenes that we will create.\nA fun afternoon for improv enthusiasts and new
 comers alike!\nNo experience required\; just an open mind and a desire to 
 meet some wonderful people\, laugh and have fun!\n━━━━━━━━
 ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nDate: Sunday
 \, November 22nd\, 2026\nArrival: Between 2:00 pm and 2:30 pm\nLocation: *
 *The Pheasant — A Firkin Pub**\nAddress: 1999 Avenue Road\, Toronto\nMee
 ting area: Back dining area\n\nJoined by my other groups too :)\n\nEvent d
 etails below\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n━━━
 ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
 ━\n**Event Details**\n**Event: Improv and Acting in the Pub**\n\n* A wel
 l-organized afternoon filled with improv games and skits\n* Lots of hilari
 ous scenes that we will create together\n* Fun for improv enthusiasts and 
 newcomers alike\n* No experience required\; just an open mind and a desire
  to meet wonderful people\, laugh and have fun\n\n━━━━━━━━
 ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n**Event fee:
 ** $10 per person\, HST included\nPayment: Cash at the event or e-transfer
  in advance to [steveflemming11@gmail.com](mailto:steveflemming11@gmail.co
 m)\n\n**Our Venue**\nWe'll be meeting in the back dining area of The Pheas
 ant — A Firkin Pub\, located at 1999 Avenue Road\, six blocks north of L
 awrence and south of Highway 401.\n**Free Parking** in residential area al
 l around the venue
