SUMMARY:Music Bingo with Friends! (Best of 7 Decades!)
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nHello everyone\,\n\nI'd like to in
 vite you out to a fun-filled afternoon with this fantastic social game cal
 led **Music Bingo with Friends! (Best of 7 Decades!)**\n\nWonderful music 
 and a super fun game!\n\n\\*Joined by my other social groups too\; so we c
 an anticipate a fabulous turn out\n\n\\*Please note we are at **The Pheasa
 nt: A Firkin Pub** at 1999 Avenue Road (roughly 6 blocks north of Lawrence
  - south of the 401 **(we are in the back dining area to find us)**\n\n*\\
 *You can also ask the wait staff or bartender if you like to show you to t
 he group (simply ask for Steve's games event)*\n\nEvent Details Below:\n\n
 Sincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 n**Details of Event:**\n**Music Bingo with Friends! (Best of 7 Decades!)**
 \n\nMusic Bingo puts a fun musical twist on traditional bingo. Instead of 
 listening for numbers\, you'll hear familiar songs from across the decades
  and mark them off on your Music Bingo card.\n\nYou don't need to be a mus
 ic expert — recognizing the songs\, singing along and enjoying the compa
 ny is all part of the fun!\n\n• **Seven decades of great music** with pl
 enty of familiar favourites\n• **Treats for our winning participants** d
 uring the different rounds\n• **Meet and mingle** with a friendly group 
 while enjoying a relaxed social atmosphere\n• **Come on your own or invi
 te some friends** — we'll get everyone settled in and ready to play\n\n*
 *Event Fee: $10**\nYour event fee includes **Music Bingo\, treats for our 
 winners\, reserved seating and plenty of music\, laughs and fun throughout
  the event.**\nPayment can be made **in cash at the event** or **in advanc
 e by e-transfer to [SteveFlemming11@gmail.com](mailto:SteveFlemming11@gmai
 l.com)**.\nIf paying by e-transfer\, please include **your name** in the m
 essage so your payment can be easily identified.\n\nBring your music memor
 ies\, your sense of humour and maybe even your singing voice — although 
 singing along is completely optional!\n\n**Friendly Reminders:**\n\nPlease
  arrive between **4:30 pm and 5:00 pm (if you can)** so you'll have time t
 o get settled\, meet some people and get ready to play. **Music Bingo will
  begin shortly afterward.**\n\n\\*Great dinner menu and food specials prov
 ided:\n(One beverage or appetizer minimum upon arrival to support venue)\n
 \n**Parking and Transportation:**\n\\*Lots of street parking on avenue and
  free residential parking\n[https://www.firkinpubs.com/thepheasantandfirki
 n/](https://www.firkinpubs.com/thepheasantandfirkin/)\n(15-20 minute walk 
 from Yonge & Lawrence subway station-or simply take bus or uber from the s
 tation)
