SUMMARY:Music Appreciation from the 1970s Social Event!
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nGood day everyone\,\n\nJoin us for
  a fun and interactive Sunday night celebrating the incredible music of th
 e 1970s! We’ll listen to great songs\, share memories and opinions\, and
  talk about the artists and music that helped define this awesome decade o
 f music!\n\nEveryone is encouraged to participate! Whether you grew up wit
 h these songs or simply love discovering great music from the past\, come 
 spend an enjoyable evening with friends and fellow music lovers.\n\nMy oth
 er social groups will be joining us too\, so we can anticipate a fabulous 
 turnout with lots of friendly people to spend the evening with!\n\nWe’ll
  be in the **back dining area** at **The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub**\, 1999 A
 venue Road\, roughly six blocks north of Lawrence and south of the 401.\n\
 nWhen you arrive\, ask the bartender to point you to Steve’s event. You
 ’ll find it’s a cozy\, relaxed and enjoyable atmosphere!\n\n**Free par
 king is available on residential side streets.**\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve F
 lemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\n**Event Details**\n\n**Music Appreciation fro
 m the 1970s Social Event!**\n\n* Listen and learn about the great music fr
 om the 1970s.\n* Share your favourite songs\, singers\, albums and bands.\
 n* Take part in fun\, interactive music discussions.\n* Hear some forgotte
 n gems and rediscover old favourites.\n* Meet other people who enjoy music
  and good conversation.\n\nCome listen\, reminisce\, laugh and enjoy a Sun
 day night of great music and great company!\n\n**Steve Flemming** has been
  a DJ since the early 2000s with a lifelong passion for music\, especially
  from the 1960s\, ’70s and ’80s. Raised by a father who was also a DJ 
 during the ’70s and ’80s\, music has always been a big part of Steve
 ’s life. He enjoys sharing great songs and bringing people together thro
 ugh music.\n\n**Event Fee**\n$5 (HST included). Pay cash at the door or by
  e-transfer to [steveflemming11@gmail.com](mailto:steveflemming11@gmail.co
 m).\nThere’s no extra charge for those attending the earlier event.\n\n*
 *Friendly Reminders**\n\n* Arrive any time between 6:30 p.m. and 8:00 p.m.
  if you can. You’re welcome to arrive earlier.\n* Please ask for Steve w
 hen you arrive.\n* A great dinner menu and food specials are available. Pl
 ease order at least one beverage or appetizer upon arrival to support the 
 venue.\n\n**Parking and Transportation**\nThere’s plenty of street parki
 ng on Avenue Road and free parking on residential side streets.\nThe pub i
 s a 15–20 minute walk from Lawrence subway station at Yonge and Lawrence
 . You can also take a bus or Uber from the station.\n[The Pheasant: A Firk
 in Pub](https://www.firkinpubs.com/thepheasantandfirkin/)
