SUMMARY:How to CRUSH a 1st Date
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nWhether you met them on a dating a
 pp or in real life.. You will have to go on a first date at some point (if
  you’re lucky\, so many flakes). So how do you make sure that you have t
 he best first date ever and avoid the common pitfalls and awkward moments.
 \n\nJoin me for a free 60-minute live webinar built for single people who 
 want to feel more confident from the first message to the follow-up.\n\n**
 In this session\, you’ll learn:**\n\n* How to text before the date witho
 ut overthinking it\n* How to plan a first date that makes conversation eas
 y\n* The simple rules that make a great impression\n* Which topics to skip
  (and what to talk about instead)\n* When and how to initiate touch\, resp
 ectfully\n* How to kindly let someone down if it’s not a match\n* When t
 o follow up after the date\, and what to say\n\nYou’ll leave with a clea
 r plan for every stage of a date\, plus a chance to ask your own questions
  live.\n\n**Who it’s for:** Single adults who want more confidence and l
 ess guesswork in their dating lives in 2027.\n\nWinter is a very romantic 
 time of year\, make the most of it and lets get you some great dates!
