SUMMARY:Friday Night FAMILY FEUD - The After Dark- Naughty and Funny Editi
 on!
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nHello everyone\,\n\nGet ready for 
 **Friday Night Family Feud – The After Dark Naughty and Funny Edition!**
  An entertaining evening of cheeky survey questions\, outrageous answers\,
  friendly competition and plenty of laughter!\n\nWe're putting a mischievo
 us adult twist on one of our favourite social games\, with questions about
  dating disasters\, romantic encounters\, flirting and hilarious bedroom m
 ishaps. You never know what the next question might reveal!\n\n*Super easy
  to learn\, play and enjoy — no experience required!*\n*Joined by my oth
 er social groups too\, so we can anticipate a fabulous turnout with lots o
 f friendly people to meet and enjoy the evening with!*\n\n**Event Details 
 Below:**\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\nmeetup.com/so
